    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "let it go? how do you even \"let go\" of a reputation that's permanently etched into the internet? it's not like i can just delete everything. even when i'm alone, i can feel the eyes on me. the version of me that people think they know is the only one that exists now. the real me is dead. i feel like a ghost haunting my own life. there's no coming back from this, is there?",
